{"id":"twitter:1702349431499026549","tweet_id":"1702349431499026549","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702349431499026549","title":"@MaxBlumenthal @elonmusk I am more than happy to walk you through possible lapses in the security requirements that people like Elon, in scope of Gove","summary":"@MaxBlumenthal @elonmusk I am more than happy to walk you through possible lapses in the security requirements that people like Elon, in scope of Government data, have to follow. You and Elon could both benefit from learning about Foreign Agents Registration Act https://www.justice.gov/nsd-fara/frequently-asked-questions https://t.co/0G0Ho9KRmC","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T15:51:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/MaxBlumenthal/status/1702346696565416205","reply_tweet_id":"1702346696565416205","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MaxBlumenthal @elonmusk I am more than happy to walk you through possible lapses in the security requirements that people like Elon, in scope of Government data, have to follow.<br><br>You and Elon could both benefit from learning about Foreign Agents Registration Act <br><br><a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/nsd-fara/frequently-asked-questions\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.justice.gov/nsd-fara/frequently-asked-questions</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/0G0Ho9KRmC\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0G0Ho9KRmC</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/40967357411a3f14c59551e1563b0ddd.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702349431499026549","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 15:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/40967357411a3f14c59551e1563b0ddd.jpg"]}
