{"id":"twitter:1702345282946514964","tweet_id":"1702345282946514964","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702345282946514964","title":"@btopro we have a couple used in microformats http://microformats.org/wiki/h-entry not sure how the JSON parsers spit them out but you can check JSON ","summary":"@btopro we have a couple used in microformats http://microformats.org/wiki/h-entry not sure how the JSON parsers spit them out but you can check JSON feed has uses url, tags, and external url what's you end goal? does anyone have a parser to use the metadata? You can use xAPI descriptions","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T15:35:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/btopro/status/1702338293332058423","reply_tweet_id":"1702338293332058423","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@btopro we have a couple used in microformats <a href=\"http://microformats.org/wiki/h-entry\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://microformats.org/wiki/h-entry</a> not sure how the JSON parsers spit them out but you can check<br><br>JSON feed has uses url, tags, and external url<br><br>what&#x27;s you end goal? does anyone have a parser to use the metadata?<br><br>You can use xAPI descriptions</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702345282946514964","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 15:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
