{"id":"twitter:1702133211973759107","tweet_id":"1702133211973759107","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702133211973759107","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX tl;dr -In scope employees have an obligation to report incidents. -You are covered under False Claims act a","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX tl;dr -In scope employees have an obligation to report incidents. -You are covered under False Claims act and qualify for portion of settlement. -Everyone has a responsibility to protect Gov's data. Don't negotiate with dictators and criminals.","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T01:32:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702130154296770942","reply_tweet_id":"1702130154296770942","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX tl;dr<br><br>-In scope employees have an obligation to report incidents.<br><br>-You are covered under False Claims act and qualify for portion of settlement.<br><br>-Everyone has a responsibility to protect Gov&#x27;s data. Don&#x27;t negotiate with dictators and criminals.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702133211973759107","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 01:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702131579760304384","tweet_id":"1702131579760304384","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702131579760304384","title":"@ClioDunn @golub Give me a good Register headline any day. The NY Post can hit occasionally, but they kissing cousins with tabloids. Still feels dirty","summary":"@ClioDunn @golub Give me a good Register headline any day. The NY Post can hit occasionally, but they kissing cousins with tabloids. Still feels dirty.... Stupid England giving us boring ass Pilgrims.","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T01:26:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ClioDunn/status/1702130866078511138","reply_tweet_id":"1702130866078511138","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @golub Give me a good Register headline any day.<br><br>The NY Post can hit occasionally, but they kissing cousins with tabloids.<br><br>Still feels dirty.... Stupid England giving us boring ass Pilgrims.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702131579760304384","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 01:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702130154296770942","tweet_id":"1702130154296770942","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702130154296770942","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Oops vetting not monitoring Assume labeling NPR state media when Kim Dotcom told you to (think the first qu","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Oops vetting not monitoring Assume labeling NPR state media when Kim Dotcom told you to (think the first question in the first Twitter space) would trigger DCSA investigators adjudicators to gather facts and make clearance determinations. We rightfully won't know this.","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T01:20:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702129267595739457","reply_tweet_id":"1702129267595739457","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Oops vetting not monitoring<br><br>Assume labeling NPR state media when Kim Dotcom told you to (think  the first question in the first Twitter space)  would trigger  DCSA investigators  adjudicators to gather facts and make clearance determinations.<br><br>We rightfully won&#x27;t know this.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702130154296770942","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 01:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702129267595739457","tweet_id":"1702129267595739457","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702129267595739457","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX no idea if Elon has a clearance & nobody should ever try to sus out if someone is cleared hard to imagine y","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX no idea if Elon has a clearance & nobody should ever try to sus out if someone is cleared hard to imagine you fill rockets full of fuel and shoot stuff in space without some kind access to cleared data. Defense Counterintelligence and Security Agency uses continuous monitoring","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T01:16:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702127972155617619","reply_tweet_id":"1702127972155617619","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX no idea if Elon has a clearance &amp; nobody should ever try to sus out if someone is cleared<br><br>hard to imagine you fill rockets full of fuel and shoot stuff in space without some kind access to cleared data.<br><br>Defense Counterintelligence and Security Agency uses continuous monitoring</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702129267595739457","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 01:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702127972155617619","tweet_id":"1702127972155617619","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702127972155617619","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Now in terms of monitoring data and telling his biographer about it, there could be MOUs or SLAs detailing ","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Now in terms of monitoring data and telling his biographer about it, there could be MOUs or SLAs detailing data sharing agreements You knowing what Elon saw and what data he correlated into live battle space imagery probably isn't covered by those agreements. Contract breach","date":"2023-09-14","published":"2023-09-14T01:11:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702104050655797588","reply_tweet_id":"1702104050655797588","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Now in terms of monitoring  data and telling his biographer about it, there could be MOUs or SLAs detailing data sharing agreements<br><br>You knowing what Elon saw and what data he correlated into live battle space imagery probably isn&#x27;t covered by those agreements.<br><br>Contract breach</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702127972155617619","display_date":"September 14, 2023 · 01:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
