{"id":"twitter:1702104050655797588","tweet_id":"1702104050655797588","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702104050655797588","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Technically at time Starlink and/or StarGuard did not have a contract with DoD at the time. That being said","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Technically at time Starlink and/or StarGuard did not have a contract with DoD at the time. That being said Elon's actions on @x and interaction with foreign agents are probably in scope for many Systems at @SpaceX. creates a risk to Gov's data that should exclude Elon","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T23:36:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ClioDunn/status/1702088473526648985","reply_tweet_id":"1702088473526648985","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Technically at time Starlink and/or StarGuard did not have a contract with DoD at the time.<br><br>That being said Elon&#x27;s actions on @x and interaction with foreign agents are probably in scope for many Systems at @SpaceX.<br><br>creates a risk to  Gov&#x27;s data that should exclude Elon</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702104050655797588","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 23:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702103235434099141","tweet_id":"1702103235434099141","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702103235434099141","title":"@Based_AH @romankulish @PMSimferopol Why don't I believe you? https://t.co/yfwXLoz8TB","summary":"@Based_AH @romankulish @PMSimferopol Why don't I believe you? https://t.co/yfwXLoz8TB","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T23:33:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LebBlitz/status/1702087491447361977","reply_tweet_id":"1702087491447361977","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Based_AH @romankulish @PMSimferopol Why don&#x27;t I believe you? <a href=\"https://t.co/yfwXLoz8TB\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/yfwXLoz8TB</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8ef45d5912e456368d8892593657a22a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702103235434099141","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 23:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8ef45d5912e456368d8892593657a22a.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1702085471524757981","tweet_id":"1702085471524757981","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702085471524757981","title":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX It's not hard. You can't regularly hang out with alleged felons wanted for criminal computer crimes and hav","summary":"@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX It's not hard. You can't regularly hang out with alleged felons wanted for criminal computer crimes and have access to Government data on their systems or your systems. Full stop. You can't negotiate foreign policy with world leaders attacking US allies. Full stop.","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T22:22:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ClioDunn/status/1702084809797890512","reply_tweet_id":"1702084809797890512","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ClioDunn @passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX It&#x27;s not hard.<br><br>You can&#x27;t regularly hang out with alleged felons wanted for criminal computer crimes and have access to Government data on their systems or your systems.<br><br>Full stop.<br><br>You can&#x27;t negotiate foreign policy with world leaders attacking US allies.<br><br>Full stop.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702085471524757981","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 22:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702084723080560670","tweet_id":"1702084723080560670","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702084723080560670","title":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Elon screams \"Compliance aint Security\" DevSecOps Bro Persona I have zero idea how many Systems Security Plans SpaceX","summary":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Elon screams \"Compliance aint Security\" DevSecOps Bro Persona I have zero idea how many Systems Security Plans SpaceX has but it's probably more than five. Probably > ten. Have evidence that security requirements are being falsified in policy and procedure? False Claims Act","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T22:19:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702084058199568452","reply_tweet_id":"1702084058199568452","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX Elon  screams &quot;Compliance aint Security&quot; DevSecOps Bro Persona<br><br>I have zero idea how many Systems Security Plans SpaceX has but it&#x27;s probably more than five. Probably &gt; ten.<br><br>Have evidence that security requirements are being falsified in policy and procedure? False Claims Act</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702084723080560670","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 22:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702084058199568452","tweet_id":"1702084058199568452","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702084058199568452","title":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX All in scope roles accessing data on Government Systems would have an assigned risk designation. With probably privil","summary":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX All in scope roles accessing data on Government Systems would have an assigned risk designation. With probably privileged access to many tier 1 systems Elon's is probably high. My guess (speculation) Elon has privileged access to systems that violate numerous SOD requirements","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T22:17:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702070135270281688","reply_tweet_id":"1702070135270281688","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX All in scope roles accessing data on Government Systems would have an assigned risk designation.<br><br>With probably privileged access to many tier 1 systems Elon&#x27;s is probably high.<br><br>My guess (speculation) Elon has privileged access to systems that violate numerous SOD requirements</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702084058199568452","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 22:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1702082165649907945","tweet_id":"1702082165649907945","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1702082165649907945","title":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX isn't even DFARS. Elon possibly dinged on FAR for that \"information posted or processed on publicly accessible inform","summary":"@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX isn't even DFARS. Elon possibly dinged on FAR for that \"information posted or processed on publicly accessible information systems\" Does SpaceX have social media policy? CEO in scope. Has to follow. Ever been asked to ignore it not report ? Be a false claims whistle blower.","date":"2023-09-13","published":"2023-09-13T22:09:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/passerby2014bye/status/1702069851576013309","reply_tweet_id":"1702069851576013309","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@passerby2014bye @ADL @X @SpaceX isn&#x27;t even DFARS. Elon possibly dinged on FAR for that<br><br> &quot;information posted or processed on publicly accessible information systems&quot;<br><br>Does SpaceX have social media policy? CEO  in scope. Has to follow.<br><br>Ever been asked to ignore it not report ? Be a false claims whistle blower.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1702082165649907945","display_date":"September 13, 2023 · 22:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
