{"id":"twitter:1701625123713712195","tweet_id":"1701625123713712195","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1701625123713712195","title":"@CantankerousH @ReclaimHosting meh old Wordpress installs always a CVE. LAMP stack is LAMP stack and OSS not always updated trying to track down the s","summary":"@CantankerousH @ReclaimHosting meh old Wordpress installs always a CVE. LAMP stack is LAMP stack and OSS not always updated trying to track down the script injections and/or infected sites now but yeah...I have seen an uptick in malicious attacks for reasons unknown to me (🤡🇷🇺🇵🇸🤡...maybe?)","date":"2023-09-12","published":"2023-09-12T15:53:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1701622073418813726","reply_tweet_id":"1701622073418813726","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CantankerousH @ReclaimHosting meh old Wordpress installs always a CVE. LAMP stack is LAMP stack and OSS not always updated trying to track down the script injections and/or infected sites now<br><br>but yeah...I have seen an uptick in malicious attacks for reasons unknown to me (🤡🇷🇺🇵🇸🤡...maybe?)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1701625123713712195","display_date":"September 12, 2023 · 15:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
