{"id":"twitter:1701584748986900811","tweet_id":"1701584748986900811","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1701584748986900811","title":"@vonhowland @MarlinFn8675309 @StratoAngst @X75071112 @BigTinyBird @WaltStevenson11 @DNC @AP If folks did want to loosely organize and focus on USA tan","summary":"@vonhowland @MarlinFn8675309 @StratoAngst @X75071112 @BigTinyBird @WaltStevenson11 @DNC @AP If folks did want to loosely organize and focus on USA tankies do it. Pacific Division is good model. Organize protests, fundraisers, etc don't need name or a hashtag, it's starts with two people working together 1. choose a charity support 2. Donate and boost 3. Bonk","date":"2023-09-12","published":"2023-09-12T13:13:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1701583675924623759","reply_tweet_id":"1701583675924623759","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@vonhowland @MarlinFn8675309 @StratoAngst @X75071112 @BigTinyBird @WaltStevenson11 @DNC @AP If folks did want to loosely organize and focus on USA tankies do it.<br><br>Pacific Division is good model. Organize protests, fundraisers, etc<br><br>don&#x27;t need name or a hashtag, it&#x27;s starts with two people working together<br><br>1. choose a charity support<br>2. Donate and boost<br>3. Bonk &amp; Block <a href=\"https://t.co/9gwpTD4Vob\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/9gwpTD4Vob</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8f9145355f2e2b7ae54c0a56e7ca4cc0.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1701584748986900811","display_date":"September 12, 2023 · 13:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8f9145355f2e2b7ae54c0a56e7ca4cc0.jpg"]}
