{"id":"twitter:1701581378221961399","tweet_id":"1701581378221961399","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1701581378221961399","title":"@PaulWHankins It was like a collective and research based approach to the science of reading before \"science of reading\" became an Astroturfed brand f","summary":"@PaulWHankins It was like a collective and research based approach to the science of reading before \"science of reading\" became an Astroturfed brand for edureformers. Hearing your review and it places agency at center of learning makes me more exciting. Gonna request our library buy this","date":"2023-09-12","published":"2023-09-12T12:59:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PaulWHankins/status/1701573515814551822","reply_tweet_id":"1701573515814551822","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PaulWHankins It was like a collective and research based approach to the science of reading before &quot;science of reading&quot; became an Astroturfed  brand for edureformers.<br><br>Hearing your review and it places agency at center of learning makes me more exciting.<br><br>Gonna request our library buy this</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1701581378221961399","display_date":"September 12, 2023 · 12:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
