{"id":"twitter:1700874123931517186","tweet_id":"1700874123931517186","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1700874123931517186","title":"@MrBiswaz Curious what do you really know of Stepan Bandera? Did you know Russia asssaniated him in 1959? Do you know he was arrested July 5, 1941 and","summary":"@MrBiswaz Curious what do you really know of Stepan Bandera? Did you know Russia asssaniated him in 1959? Do you know he was arrested July 5, 1941 and spent rest of war in a Concentration Camp? Do you know he was exiled, never returned to Ukraine? Why does any of that justify genocide?","date":"2023-09-10","published":"2023-09-10T14:09:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1700869951874367690","reply_tweet_id":"1700869951874367690","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MrBiswaz Curious what do you really know of Stepan Bandera?<br><br>Did you know Russia asssaniated him in 1959?<br><br>Do you know he was arrested July 5, 1941 and spent rest of war in a Concentration Camp?<br><br>Do you know he was exiled, never returned to Ukraine?<br><br>Why does any of that justify genocide?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1700874123931517186","display_date":"September 10, 2023 · 14:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
