{"id":"twitter:1700837993722863739","tweet_id":"1700837993722863739","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1700837993722863739","title":"@JamesMac064 @bandrui0 DFARS 252.209-7002 \"Any individual acting on behalf of a foreign government.\" is considered \"effective foreign ownership\" By ca","summary":"@JamesMac064 @bandrui0 DFARS 252.209-7002 \"Any individual acting on behalf of a foreign government.\" is considered \"effective foreign ownership\" By calling Putin and doing his bidding, Elon violated the law. @Starlink employees had 72 hours to report this incident.","date":"2023-09-10","published":"2023-09-10T11:45:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1700832779255132420","reply_tweet_id":"1700832779255132420","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JamesMac064 @bandrui0 DFARS 252.209-7002<br><br>&quot;Any individual acting on behalf of a foreign government.&quot; is considered &quot;effective foreign ownership&quot;<br><br>By calling Putin and doing his bidding, Elon violated the law.<br><br>@Starlink employees had 72 hours to report this incident.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1700837993722863739","display_date":"September 10, 2023 · 11:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
