{"id":"twitter:1698101803349328132","tweet_id":"1698101803349328132","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1698101803349328132","title":"@ANyulund @mhmck @Official_NAFO You don't wanna go down this rabbit hole with me. I can talk for days on my theories about Russian active measures in ","summary":"@ANyulund @mhmck @Official_NAFO You don't wanna go down this rabbit hole with me. I can talk for days on my theories about Russian active measures in the American neonazi scene. And this was before before 2016. After 2016. It got worse, and I fell for some Azov stuff too. Why disinfo is more than \"online\" https://t.co/Btx04lts3H","date":"2023-09-02","published":"2023-09-02T22:33:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1698100753879937273","reply_tweet_id":"1698100753879937273","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ANyulund @mhmck @Official_NAFO You don&#x27;t wanna go down this rabbit hole with me.<br><br>I can talk for days on my theories about Russian active measures in the American neonazi scene.<br><br>And this was before before 2016.<br><br>After 2016. It got worse, and I fell for some Azov stuff too.<br><br>Why disinfo is more than &quot;online&quot; <a href=\"https://t.co/Btx04lts3H\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Btx04lts3H</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/87c2813fbcd1064cd0113590577b55ac.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/45f6fe63caf1805fa846b133a2f6806d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/dd0197650a794e24647584ba12359615.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/77614533824b93377dceb4fb14cd7530.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1698101803349328132","display_date":"September