{"id":"twitter:1698097585947369918","tweet_id":"1698097585947369918","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1698097585947369918","title":"@ANyulund @mhmck Yes the Russian \"diaspora\" is a target. More so in places like Ukraine and the Baltics rather than Russian community. Canadian Russia","summary":"@ANyulund @mhmck Yes the Russian \"diaspora\" is a target. More so in places like Ukraine and the Baltics rather than Russian community. Canadian Russian immigrant community targeted more heavily in US (i think... No data). But don't think disinfo as just online stuff. Meatspace targeted too https://t.co/SMUifVg6DU","date":"2023-09-02","published":"2023-09-02T22:16:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1698094578727784590","reply_tweet_id":"1698094578727784590","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ANyulund @mhmck Yes the  Russian &quot;diaspora&quot; is a target.<br><br>More so in places like Ukraine and the Baltics rather than Russian community.<br><br>Canadian Russian immigrant community targeted more heavily in US (i think... No data).<br><br>But don&#x27;t think disinfo as just online stuff.<br><br>Meatspace targeted too <a href=\"https://t.co/SMUifVg6DU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/SMUifVg6DU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/df4035643a759ed285cca2c3c38d7521.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7c6ee5fcd44436078b567f1f58c00285.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1698097585947369918","display_date":"September 02, 2023 · 22:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/df4035643a759ed285cca2c3c38d7521.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/7c6ee5fcd44436078b567f1f58c00285.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1698096300787478561","tweet_id":"1698096300787478561","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1698096300787478561","title":"@ANyulund @mhmck There have been a few studies: https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=disinformation&s[]=disinformation Elon's API chan","summary":"@ANyulund @mhmck There have been a few studies: https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=disinformation&s[]=disinformation Elon's API changes and removing Public twitter has made it almost impossible. Those key terms I gave you will reveal mainly sock puppets Recent research, around time of CPAC, found 75% of all new MAGA accounts fake https://t.","date":"2023-09-02","published":"2023-09-02T22:11:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1698093888282538481","reply_tweet_id":"1698093888282538481","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ANyulund @mhmck There have been a few studies: <a href=\"https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=disinformation&amp;s[]=disinformation\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=disinformation&amp;s[]=disinformation</a><br><br>Elon&#x27;s API changes and removing Public twitter has made it almost impossible.<br><br>Those key terms I gave you will reveal mainly sock puppets<br><br>Recent research, around time of CPAC, found 75% of all new MAGA accounts fake <a href=\"https://t.co/aVSPz3L8GI\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/aVSPz3L8GI</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9ab63aaff7c8902de5a881bb44c7223b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1698096300787478561","display_date":"September 02, 2023 · 22:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9ab63aaff7c8902de5a881bb44c7223b.jpg"]}
