{"id":"twitter:1697296032567009464","tweet_id":"1697296032567009464","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1697296032567009464","title":"@tjoosten same plagiarism fears they had with photocopiers It's an inherent bias towards the corrupted learner rather than subpar curriculum I stress ","summary":"@tjoosten same plagiarism fears they had with photocopiers It's an inherent bias towards the corrupted learner rather than subpar curriculum I stress two points: -Forget ChatGPT, focus on how we train LLM and Machine Learning in your discipline -Break things into metacognitive steps,","date":"2023-08-31","published":"2023-08-31T17:11:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tjoosten/status/1697294489545515278","reply_tweet_id":"1697294489545515278","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tjoosten same plagiarism fears they had with photocopiers<br><br>It&#x27;s an inherent bias towards the corrupted learner rather than subpar curriculum <br><br>I stress two points:<br>-Forget ChatGPT, focus on how we train LLM and Machine Learning in your discipline<br>-Break things into metacognitive steps,</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1697296032567009464","display_date":"August 31, 2023 · 17:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
