{"id":"twitter:1697033320947675473","tweet_id":"1697033320947675473","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1697033320947675473","title":"@CoachMikeDixon @Lori74458665 @Pete2Shawn @KyleSeraphin @RealStevefriend @tracybeanz @UncoverDC I did not say anything about my politics. It isn't a c","summary":"@CoachMikeDixon @Lori74458665 @Pete2Shawn @KyleSeraphin @RealStevefriend @tracybeanz @UncoverDC I did not say anything about my politics. It isn't a conservative or liberal thing to do. It is the morally correct thing to do. I also disagree with you overall assessment and think Russia conspired to overthrow our Government. Russia has attacked US for well ove","date":"2023-08-30","published":"2023-08-30T23:47:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CoachMikeDixon/status/1697030366266003693","reply_tweet_id":"1697030366266003693","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CoachMikeDixon @Lori74458665 @Pete2Shawn @KyleSeraphin @RealStevefriend @tracybeanz @UncoverDC I did not say anything about my politics.<br><br>It isn&#x27;t a conservative or liberal thing to do.<br><br>It is the morally correct thing to do.<br><br>I also disagree with you overall assessment and think Russia conspired to overthrow our Government.<br><br>Russia has attacked US for well over a decade <a href=\"https://t.co/5bKX4NksJj\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/5bKX4NksJj</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1e6b088ea751a278f291e025abd0cd54.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1697033320947675473","display_date":"August 30, 2023 · 23:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1e6b088ea751a278f291e025abd0cd54.jpg"]}
