{"id":"twitter:1696202435617059102","tweet_id":"1696202435617059102","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696202435617059102","title":"@_KNOWN_STUDIO_ @Maks_NAFO_FELLA If they are weapons systems documents THEY DO NOT touch online AI tools. (unless authorized on gov tools) It's logica","summary":"@_KNOWN_STUDIO_ @Maks_NAFO_FELLA If they are weapons systems documents THEY DO NOT touch online AI tools. (unless authorized on gov tools) It's logical if you think about it These are often classified documents for all the public technical documents, like from NIST (or the EU equivalent) those can be used.","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T16:45:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/_KNOWN_STUDIO_/status/1696201590317760750","reply_tweet_id":"1696201590317760750","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@_KNOWN_STUDIO_ @Maks_NAFO_FELLA If they are weapons systems documents THEY DO NOT touch online AI tools.<br><br>(unless authorized on gov tools)<br><br>It&#x27;s logical if you think about it<br><br>These are often classified documents<br><br>for all the public technical documents, like from NIST (or the EU equivalent) those can be used.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696202435617059102","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 16:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
