{"id":"twitter:1696191139802706066","tweet_id":"1696191139802706066","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696191139802706066","title":"@MarlinFn8675309 @letaville1 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA Ukrainian and Polish gaming and dev communities are full of people who navigate between technical docs Y","summary":"@MarlinFn8675309 @letaville1 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA Ukrainian and Polish gaming and dev communities are full of people who navigate between technical docs You need to know what stays in English, what is a Trademark product name, etc While English is the lingua franca of technical documentation we need push for more inclusion","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T16:00:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696190773631553894","reply_tweet_id":"1696190773631553894","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MarlinFn8675309 @letaville1 @Maks_NAFO_FELLA Ukrainian and Polish gaming and dev communities are full of people who navigate between technical docs<br><br>You need to know what stays in English, what is a Trademark product name, etc<br><br>While English is the lingua franca of technical documentation we need push for more inclusion</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696191139802706066","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 16:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
