{"id":"twitter:1696145553652937020","tweet_id":"1696145553652937020","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696145553652937020","title":"@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta The four Americans who traveled to \"fight\" were also arrested at UniteTheRight. UniteTheRight was partly organized by \"Th","summary":"@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta The four Americans who traveled to \"fight\" were also arrested at UniteTheRight. UniteTheRight was partly organized by \"The Right Sector\" They were stood up by this guy Charles Bausman No way Rise Above Movement (RAM) makes it to Ukraine without Russian help No way. https://t.co/jKYYXSm46j","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T12:59:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696144822472450493","reply_tweet_id":"1696144822472450493","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta The four Americans who traveled to &quot;fight&quot; were also arrested at UniteTheRight.<br><br>UniteTheRight was partly organized by &quot;The Right Sector&quot;<br><br>They were stood up by this guy Charles Bausman<br><br>No way Rise Above Movement (RAM) makes it to Ukraine without Russian help<br><br>No way. <a href=\"https://t.co/jKYYXSm46j\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/jKYYXSm46j</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/cbc278eae1b1b7aef53a3dc810e2bfce.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696145553652937020","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 12:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/cbc278eae1b1b7aef53a3dc810e2bfce.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1696144822472450493","tweet_id":"1696144822472450493","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696144822472450493","title":"@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta My theory is that Russia tried to create far-right extremists in Ukraine and had early agitators embeded into far-right o","summary":"@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta My theory is that Russia tried to create far-right extremists in Ukraine and had early agitators embeded into far-right orgs Russia wasn't ready to invade in 2014, wanted more far-right discord first, but Maidan called Russia's hand So Russia started to seed Atomwaffen Division https://t.co/VAfbc5sMUW","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T12:56:53+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1696139082693230889","reply_tweet_id":"1696139082693230889","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@willisfx88 @DemianZ @Acosta My theory is that Russia tried to create far-right extremists in Ukraine and had early agitators embeded into far-right orgs<br><br>Russia wasn&#x27;t ready to invade in 2014, wanted more far-right discord first, but Maidan called Russia&#x27;s hand<br><br>So Russia started to seed Atomwaffen Division <a href=\"https://t.co/VAfbc5sMUW\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/VAfbc5sMUW</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/aa318a0947aa0c2166734895c9b56bee.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696144822472450493","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 12:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/aa318a0947aa0c2166734895c9b56bee.jpg"]}
