{"id":"twitter:1696128548010913954","tweet_id":"1696128548010913954","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696128548010913954","title":"@MagellanAzorean You would make a great @Wikipedia editor. Don't start with a contentious topic or anything where you have expertise. (you need 500 ed","summary":"@MagellanAzorean You would make a great @Wikipedia editor. Don't start with a contentious topic or anything where you have expertise. (you need 500 edits to touch war articles) I recommend cultural articles. @wikimedia_ua keeps an awesome list for our events https://meta.m.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T11:52:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696126103218225441","reply_tweet_id":"1696126103218225441","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MagellanAzorean You would make a great @Wikipedia editor.<br><br>Don&#x27;t start with a contentious topic or anything where you have expertise.<br><br>(you need 500 edits to touch war articles) <br><br>I recommend cultural articles. @wikimedia_ua keeps an awesome list for our events<br><br><a href=\"https://meta.m.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://meta.m.wikimedia.org/wiki/Ukraine%27s_Cultural_Diplomacy_Month_2023/List</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696128548010913954","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 11:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1696126103218225441","tweet_id":"1696126103218225441","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1696126103218225441","title":"@MagellanAzorean We need more editors. The Russification of Wikipedia massive You need to be an extended confirmed editor for Russia and Ukraine artic","summary":"@MagellanAzorean We need more editors. The Russification of Wikipedia massive You need to be an extended confirmed editor for Russia and Ukraine articles. The rule is Wikipedia uses secondary sources to avoid bias of self-publication of original research. Have to negotiate meaning","date":"2023-08-28","published":"2023-08-28T11:42:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/MagellanAzorean/status/1696122495902830885","reply_tweet_id":"1696122495902830885","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MagellanAzorean We need more editors.<br><br>The Russification of Wikipedia massive<br><br>You  need to be an extended confirmed editor for Russia and Ukraine articles. <br><br>The rule is Wikipedia uses secondary sources to avoid bias of self-publication of original research.<br><br>Have to negotiate meaning</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1696126103218225441","display_date":"August 28, 2023 · 11:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
