{"id":"twitter:1695443495605920219","tweet_id":"1695443495605920219","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1695443495605920219","title":"@AndrewsBob123 @Nuromanca @MimmsAlex @Azovsouth I look at the actions of Russia to justify providing Ukraine with a well regulated militia necessary f","summary":"@AndrewsBob123 @Nuromanca @MimmsAlex @Azovsouth I look at the actions of Russia to justify providing Ukraine with a well regulated militia necessary for the security of the state. Trying to draw a conspiracy between Ukraine and Covid is just silly, silly. Don't do that. It is icky and it is used to hide Russian genocide https://t.co/nhUeypgMqz","date":"2023-08-26","published":"2023-08-26T14:30:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AndrewsBob123/status/1695443038426874252","reply_tweet_id":"1695443038426874252","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AndrewsBob123 @Nuromanca @MimmsAlex @Azovsouth I look at the actions of Russia to justify providing Ukraine with a well regulated militia necessary for the security of the state.<br><br>Trying to draw a conspiracy between Ukraine and Covid is just silly, silly.<br><br>Don&#x27;t do that. It is icky and it is used to hide Russian genocide <a href=\"https://t.co/nhUeypgMqz\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/nhUeypgMqz</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bc5dd373a0265c345054f2fe978f4407.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1695443495605920219","display_date":"August 26, 2023 · 14:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bc5dd373a0265c345054f2fe978f4407.jpg"]}
