{"id":"twitter:1695432167277371565","tweet_id":"1695432167277371565","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1695432167277371565","title":"@tomochef1967 @DefenceHQ No How is it a proxy war if Russia invaded Ukraine Ulkrainians do not have to liberate Ukraine from a Russian proxy. Ukrainia","summary":"@tomochef1967 @DefenceHQ No How is it a proxy war if Russia invaded Ukraine Ulkrainians do not have to liberate Ukraine from a Russian proxy. Ukrainians must liberate Ukraine from Russia Thus, no proxy A real war of Imperialist conquest https://t.co/FxMxgbSBWs","date":"2023-08-26","published":"2023-08-26T13:45:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/tomochef1967/status/1695376173709017142","reply_tweet_id":"1695376173709017142","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@tomochef1967 @DefenceHQ No<br><br>How is it a proxy war if Russia invaded Ukraine<br><br>Ulkrainians do not have to liberate Ukraine from a Russian proxy.<br><br>Ukrainians must liberate Ukraine from Russia<br><br>Thus, no proxy<br><br>A real war of Imperialist conquest <a href=\"https://t.co/FxMxgbSBWs\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/FxMxgbSBWs</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/457af0b6f981495ab4a0beb760145d2d.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1695432167277371565","display_date":"August 26, 2023 · 13:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/457af0b6f981495ab4a0beb760145d2d.jpg"]}
