{"id":"twitter:1695233247528042779","tweet_id":"1695233247528042779","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1695233247528042779","title":"@ThomasHoufek I never said I wanted an International Law against misinformation. I said I think we need to have conversations about domestic and inter","summary":"@ThomasHoufek I never said I wanted an International Law against misinformation. I said I think we need to have conversations about domestic and international cyber terrorism laws that include state based attacks on information. We can disagree. That is okay.","date":"2023-08-26","published":"2023-08-26T00:34:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ThomasHoufek/status/1695232020731851215","reply_tweet_id":"1695232020731851215","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ThomasHoufek I never said I wanted an International Law against misinformation.<br><br>I said I think we need to have conversations about domestic and international cyber terrorism laws that include state based attacks on information.<br><br>We can disagree.<br><br>That is okay.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1695233247528042779","display_date":"August 26, 2023 · 00:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
