{"id":"twitter:1694415695667241077","tweet_id":"1694415695667241077","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694415695667241077","title":"@blkunicornrose The aid going to Ukraine are draw downs of American kit and munitions using Lend Lease. Aid packages to Maui will come from different ","summary":"@blkunicornrose The aid going to Ukraine are draw downs of American kit and munitions using Lend Lease. Aid packages to Maui will come from different budget lines You can disagree with aid to Ukraine. You can want more aid for Hawai'i but don't conflate the two. That is a #disinfo campaign https://t.co/G8XCTVxOjY","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T18:25:57+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/blkunicornrose/status/1694415005113020434","reply_tweet_id":"1694415005113020434","tags":["disinfo"],"body_html":"<p>@blkunicornrose The aid going to Ukraine are draw downs of American kit and munitions using Lend Lease.<br><br>Aid packages to Maui will come from different budget lines<br><br>You can disagree with aid to Ukraine. You can want more aid for Hawai&#x27;i<br><br>but don&#x27;t conflate the two. That is a #disinfo campaign <a href=\"https://t.co/G8XCTVxOjY\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/G8XCTVxOjY</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a83631bce85e9a1f39a8968d56beaa99.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694415695667241077","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 18:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a83631bce85e9a1f39a8968d56beaa99.jpg"]}
