{"id":"twitter:1694376183431934055","tweet_id":"1694376183431934055","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694376183431934055","title":"These aren't just suggestions. Almost every school has access to federal data on non-government systems Schools have a legal responsibility to provide","summary":"These aren't just suggestions. Almost every school has access to federal data on non-government systems Schools have a legal responsibility to provide annual awareness and training to in scope employees. Why not include all students and teachers who touch PII under FERPA? https://x.com/CISAgov/status/1694371864477360428","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T15:48:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>These aren&#x27;t just suggestions. Almost every school has access to federal data on non-government systems<br><br>Schools have a legal responsibility to provide annual awareness and training to in scope employees.<br><br>Why not include all students and teachers who touch PII under FERPA? <a href=\"https://x.com/CISAgov/status/1694371864477360428\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/CISAgov/status/1694371864477360428</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694376183431934055","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 15:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694375561156592057","tweet_id":"1694375561156592057","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694375561156592057","title":"@remstacenter many things it comes down to GRC hacks near me. New Haven, millions stolen,social engineering. No policy on two signatures on checks Ham","summary":"@remstacenter many things it comes down to GRC hacks near me. New Haven, millions stolen,social engineering. No policy on two signatures on checks Hamden. Ransomware, millions stolen. remove firewall to install HVAC didn't turn it on. all alarms should have rang #REMSChatWithAnExpert","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T15:46:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/remstacenter/status/1694373932864843927","reply_tweet_id":"1694373932864843927","tags":["REMSChatWithAnExpert"],"body_html":"<p>@remstacenter many things it comes down to GRC<br><br> hacks near me. <br><br>New Haven,  millions stolen,social engineering. No policy on two signatures on checks <br><br>Hamden. Ransomware, millions stolen. remove firewall to install HVAC didn&#x27;t turn it on. all alarms should have rang<br><br>#REMSChatWithAnExpert</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694375561156592057","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 15:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694374133230911607","tweet_id":"1694374133230911607","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694374133230911607","title":"@WGrant72 schools also getting attacked by quasi-state actors. Should it be job of local school board alone to defend our borders from foreign assault","summary":"@WGrant72 schools also getting attacked by quasi-state actors. Should it be job of local school board alone to defend our borders from foreign assaults on networks? I tell cyber folk to poach K12 IT all the time. They are miracle workers and do much with nothing #REMSChatWithAnExpert","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T15:40:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/WGrant72/status/1694372591786418446","reply_tweet_id":"1694372591786418446","tags":["REMSChatWithAnExpert"],"body_html":"<p>@WGrant72 schools also getting attacked by quasi-state actors.<br><br>Should it be job of  local school board alone to defend our borders from foreign assaults on networks?<br><br>I tell cyber folk to poach K12 IT all the time. They are miracle workers and do much with nothing<br><br>#REMSChatWithAnExpert</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694374133230911607","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 15:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694372425515803126","tweet_id":"1694372425515803126","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694372425515803126","title":"@remstacenter ensure OS and software get updated on school owned devices create public & private wifi network make sure teachers know data deletion po","summary":"@remstacenter ensure OS and software get updated on school owned devices create public & private wifi network make sure teachers know data deletion policy. No high-schooler wants to be embarrassed by an 8 year old Flipgrid for students give them training on malicious links and pass phrases","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T15:34:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694371608951923048","reply_tweet_id":"1694371608951923048","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@remstacenter ensure OS and software get updated on school owned devices<br><br>create public &amp; private wifi network<br><br>make sure teachers know data deletion policy. No high-schooler wants to be embarrassed by an 8 year old Flipgrid<br><br>for students give them training on malicious links and pass phrases</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694372425515803126","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 15:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694371608951923048","tweet_id":"1694371608951923048","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694371608951923048","title":"@remstacenter A5 Ensure stakeholders know FERPA responsibilities Have a data retention and deletion policy Utilize a self-service store and control au","summary":"@remstacenter A5 Ensure stakeholders know FERPA responsibilities Have a data retention and deletion policy Utilize a self-service store and control authorized apps with an approved list of vendors do not allow sms MFA for privileged accounts","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T15:30:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/remstacenter/status/1694370158121472386","reply_tweet_id":"1694370158121472386","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@remstacenter A5 Ensure stakeholders know FERPA responsibilities<br><br>Have a data retention and deletion  policy<br><br>Utilize a self-service store and control authorized apps with an approved list of vendors<br><br>do not allow sms MFA for privileged accounts</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694371608951923048","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 15:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
