{"id":"twitter:1694354913659077095","tweet_id":"1694354913659077095","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694354913659077095","title":"@BravoKilo6464 I really really hope this was also one full of all the countermeasures Those have to a finite supply...and seem to be the most vulnerab","summary":"@BravoKilo6464 I really really hope this was also one full of all the countermeasures Those have to a finite supply...and seem to be the most vulnerable of MI-8s It's weirdly awesome how they keep going offline","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T14:24:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/BravoKilo6464/status/1694328030087246258","reply_tweet_id":"1694328030087246258","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BravoKilo6464 I really really hope this was also one full of all the countermeasures<br><br>Those have to a  finite supply...and seem to be the most vulnerable of MI-8s<br><br>It&#x27;s weirdly awesome how they keep going offline</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694354913659077095","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 14:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694352625460805704","tweet_id":"1694352625460805704","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694352625460805704","title":"@CKikila I work with folks whose companies forbid LinkedIn to access gov data I get immense value from LinkedIn I use it for bizdev and learning non-s","summary":"@CKikila I work with folks whose companies forbid LinkedIn to access gov data I get immense value from LinkedIn I use it for bizdev and learning non-stop. I check in every morning and wake up to DJ Hondo. problem is diff between Sales and Social Engineering is just a different CTA","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T14:15:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CKikila/status/1694350619040178304","reply_tweet_id":"1694350619040178304","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CKikila I work with folks whose companies forbid LinkedIn to access gov data<br><br>I get immense value from LinkedIn<br><br>I use it for bizdev and learning non-stop. I check in every morning and wake up to DJ Hondo.<br><br>problem is  diff between Sales and Social Engineering is just a different CTA</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694352625460805704","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 14:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1694351196725592357","tweet_id":"1694351196725592357","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694351196725592357","title":"You don't want to and can't stop employees from sharing resumes. But you can, should, no must, have social media use policies and procedures. LinkedIn","summary":"You don't want to and can't stop employees from sharing resumes. But you can, should, no must, have social media use policies and procedures. LinkedIn social engineering real You have legal responsibility to ensure in scope assets know about these threats and how to counter. https://t.co/fsqfNEkLmK","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T14:09:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694350531211215026","reply_tweet_id":"1694350531211215026","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You don&#x27;t want to and can&#x27;t stop employees from sharing resumes.<br><br>But you can, should, no must,  have social media use policies and procedures.<br><br>LinkedIn social engineering real<br><br>You have legal responsibility to ensure in scope assets know about these threats and how to counter. <a href=\"https://t.co/fsqfNEkLmK\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/fsqfNEkLmK</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7affbcde6a40c305c79af2f990d1d5e9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694351196725592357","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 14:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7affbcde6a40c305c79af2f990d1d5e9.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1694350531211215026","tweet_id":"1694350531211215026","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1694350531211215026","title":"Please open your: Internal Risk Table tops Annual awareness and training HR manuals Have procedures about what company info goes on LinkedIn. Have goo","summary":"Please open your: Internal Risk Table tops Annual awareness and training HR manuals Have procedures about what company info goes on LinkedIn. Have good guidance on personal use. These activities are being used to compromise in-scope federal and non-federal systems. https://t.co/JIPbznTG23","date":"2023-08-23","published":"2023-08-23T14:07:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694344545008226793","reply_tweet_id":"1694344545008226793","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Please open your:  <br>Internal Risk Table tops<br> Annual awareness and training<br> HR manuals<br> <br>Have  procedures about what company info goes on LinkedIn.<br><br>Have good guidance on personal use.  <br><br>These activities are being used to compromise in-scope federal and non-federal systems. <a href=\"https://t.co/JIPbznTG23\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/JIPbznTG23</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/daf222f26e4293c24adfa636356c160b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1694350531211215026","display_date":"August 23, 2023 · 14:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/daf222f26e4293c24adfa636356c160b.jpg"]}
