{"id":"twitter:1693664882124636349","tweet_id":"1693664882124636349","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693664882124636349","title":"A found poem from Transcript of Leonid Brezhnev's Telephone Conversation with Alexander Dubček, August 13, 1968 Words have always been deeds for words","summary":"A found poem from Transcript of Leonid Brezhnev's Telephone Conversation with Alexander Dubček, August 13, 1968 Words have always been deeds for words have always been Russia's most dangerous and deployed weapon. The script never changes. Just a new cast of monsters #nafo","date":"2023-08-21","published":"2023-08-21T16:42:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693664186000195613","reply_tweet_id":"1693664186000195613","tags":["nafo"],"body_html":"<p>A found poem from Transcript of Leonid Brezhnev&#x27;s Telephone  Conversation with Alexander Dubček, August 13, 1968<br><br>Words have always been deeds for words have always been Russia&#x27;s most dangerous and deployed weapon.<br><br>The script never changes. Just a new cast of monsters<br><br>#nafo</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693664882124636349","display_date":"August 21, 2023 · 16:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1693664186000195613","tweet_id":"1693664186000195613","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693664186000195613","title":"Sasha felt need to speak turning to you with anxiety about mass media warned you rightist forces will not easily give up Restore order in mass media. ","summary":"Sasha felt need to speak turning to you with anxiety about mass media warned you rightist forces will not easily give up Restore order in mass media. Literární listy, Mlada fronta, Reporter, Prace every day publishing anti-Soviet and anti- party articles #smallpoems","date":"2023-08-21","published":"2023-08-21T16:39:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Sasha<br> felt need to speak<br>turning to you with anxiety<br> about <br>mass media<br>warned you rightist <br>forces will not easily give up<br>Restore order in <br> mass media.<br>Literární listy, Mlada fronta,  Reporter, Prace<br>every day <br>publishing<br> anti-Soviet and <br>anti- party articles<br><br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693664186000195613","display_date":"August 21, 2023 · 16:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
