{"id":"twitter:1693335592245838218","tweet_id":"1693335592245838218","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693335592245838218","title":"Let's hear your best Andy. https://x.com/JoohnChoe/status/1693327317811253340","summary":"Let's hear your best Andy. https://x.com/JoohnChoe/status/1693327317811253340","date":"2023-08-20","published":"2023-08-20T18:54:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Let&#x27;s hear your best Andy. <a href=\"https://x.com/JoohnChoe/status/1693327317811253340\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/JoohnChoe/status/1693327317811253340</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693335592245838218","display_date":"August 20, 2023 · 18:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1693331305402921288","tweet_id":"1693331305402921288","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693331305402921288","title":"@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua The bigger danger are pdfs downloaded from both ua and ru Domains often picked up by Google Scholar. T","summary":"@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua The bigger danger are pdfs downloaded from both ua and ru Domains often picked up by Google Scholar. Those have carried some malware. A Russian university.... Might be safer... But everyone has their own threat tolerance. And people in some jobs may have rules against dot ru","date":"2023-08-20","published":"2023-08-20T18:36:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693330635450892438","reply_tweet_id":"1693330635450892438","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua The bigger danger are pdfs downloaded from both ua and ru Domains often picked up by Google Scholar.<br><br>Those have carried some malware.<br><br>A Russian university.... Might be safer... But everyone has their own threat tolerance.<br><br>And people in some jobs may have rules against dot ru</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693331305402921288","display_date":"August 20, 2023 · 18:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1693330635450892438","tweet_id":"1693330635450892438","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693330635450892438","title":"@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua Yeah my University doesn't allow dot ru Domains on their networks. Though devices can access from home","summary":"@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua Yeah my University doesn't allow dot ru Domains on their networks. Though devices can access from home. I make it so I don't have privileged access on my device. Have to log in with different credentials. So I end up behind updates ans unsecure... And dance starts again.","date":"2023-08-20","published":"2023-08-20T18:34:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/roosefella/status/1693328413480595847","reply_tweet_id":"1693328413480595847","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@roosefella @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua Yeah my University doesn&#x27;t allow dot ru Domains on their networks.<br><br>Though devices can access from home.<br><br>I make it so I don&#x27;t have privileged access on my device. Have to log in with different credentials.<br><br>So I end up behind updates ans unsecure... And dance starts again.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693330635450892438","display_date":"August 20, 2023 · 18:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
