{"id":"twitter:1693318482199290238","tweet_id":"1693318482199290238","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693318482199290238","title":"@DefenestreKarel @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua That's okay. You build off previous work. You just don't cite yourself first. The book is same bl","summary":"@DefenestreKarel @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua That's okay. You build off previous work. You just don't cite yourself first. The book is same blah blah too many big words. Americans, the land of shorter letters, trying to write Russian nonsense. More interesting is to examine the citations and/or where it's hosted.","date":"2023-08-20","published":"2023-08-20T17:46:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DefenestreKarel/status/1693314570247381326","reply_tweet_id":"1693314570247381326","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@DefenestreKarel @bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua That&#x27;s okay.<br><br>You build off previous work.<br><br>You just don&#x27;t cite yourself first.<br><br>The book is same blah blah too many big words.<br><br>Americans, the land of shorter letters, trying to write Russian nonsense.<br><br>More interesting is to examine the citations and/or where it&#x27;s hosted.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693318482199290238","display_date":"August 20, 2023 · 17:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
