{"id":"twitter:1693236238046601245","tweet_id":"1693236238046601245","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1693236238046601245","title":"@bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua I searched my tweets. @DefenestreKarel did the heroic thing of reading Andy's dribble first. But NAFO works becaus","summary":"@bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua I searched my tweets. @DefenestreKarel did the heroic thing of reading Andy's dribble first. But NAFO works because nobody seeks credit. We just retweet stuff. Telling and exposing the truth shouldn't be special. It should be expected.","date":"2023-08-20","published":"2023-08-20T12:19:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693224210212983104","reply_tweet_id":"1693224210212983104","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@bucktron2021 @AKorybko @U24_gov_ua I searched my tweets. @DefenestreKarel did the heroic thing of reading Andy&#x27;s dribble first.<br><br>But NAFO works because nobody seeks credit. We just retweet stuff. <br><br>Telling and exposing the truth shouldn&#x27;t be special.<br><br>It should be expected.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1693236238046601245","display_date":"August 20, 2023 · 12:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
