{"id":"twitter:1691869720410984950","tweet_id":"1691869720410984950","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691869720410984950","title":"Hey #HigherEd do you see this in the National Cyber Workforce and Education Strategy? You want Federal Aid you want Federal Grants? Be prepared to hos","summary":"Hey #HigherEd do you see this in the National Cyber Workforce and Education Strategy? You want Federal Aid you want Federal Grants? Be prepared to host that data in -171 environments. You have already gotten the Dear John letters about FERPA data, Grant money next Good https://t.co/gyNRNndHm9","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:49:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691867029379183039","reply_tweet_id":"1691867029379183039","tags":["HigherEd"],"body_html":"<p>Hey #HigherEd do you see this in the National Cyber Workforce and Education Strategy?<br><br>You want Federal Aid you want Federal Grants?<br><br>Be prepared to host that data in -171 environments.<br><br>You have already gotten the Dear John letters about FERPA data, <br><br>Grant money next<br><br>Good <a href=\"https://t.co/gyNRNndHm9\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/gyNRNndHm9</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e202206c2e7dbe34846f2a774ab425e2.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691869720410984950","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e202206c2e7dbe34846f2a774ab425e2.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1691867029379183039","tweet_id":"1691867029379183039","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691867029379183039","title":"Web is the knowledge network. Don't over engineer an OER solution. Instead focus on lofi-nofi localized tools easily deployed. My idea is federate OKN","summary":"Web is the knowledge network. Don't over engineer an OER solution. Instead focus on lofi-nofi localized tools easily deployed. My idea is federate OKNs through local libraries...bc we have done that since we have invented libraries Internet not new, just faster patterns https://t.co/J0IFk9JO5X","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:38:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691866218490196140","reply_tweet_id":"1691866218490196140","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Web is the knowledge network. Don&#x27;t over engineer an OER solution.<br><br>Instead focus on lofi-nofi localized tools easily deployed.<br><br>My idea is federate OKNs through local libraries...bc we have done that since we have invented libraries<br><br>Internet not new, just faster patterns <a href=\"https://t.co/J0IFk9JO5X\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/J0IFk9JO5X</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7018912f3217eda4e21786875657ed9e.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691867029379183039","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7018912f3217eda4e21786875657ed9e.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1691866218490196140","tweet_id":"1691866218490196140","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691866218490196140","title":"Streamline SBIR pipelines around the organizations that get touched. A lot of this funding got passed in the NDAA but each Agency will have their own ","summary":"Streamline SBIR pipelines around the organizations that get touched. A lot of this funding got passed in the NDAA but each Agency will have their own SBA SBIR program. Nothing like DOD...Though SOCOM has given out some Directs for fighting disinformation in Africa coordinate https://t.co/c59CGVtREN","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:35:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691865401062248709","reply_tweet_id":"1691865401062248709","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Streamline SBIR pipelines around the organizations that get touched.<br><br>A lot of this funding got passed in the NDAA but each Agency will have their own SBA SBIR program.<br><br>Nothing like DOD...Though SOCOM has given out some Directs for fighting disinformation in Africa<br><br>coordinate <a href=\"https://t.co/c59CGVtREN\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/c59CGVtREN</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/04f87949da877c0b17de3c4e02d05749.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691866218490196140","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/04f87949da877c0b17de3c4e02d05749.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1691865401062248709","tweet_id":"1691865401062248709","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691865401062248709","title":"So glad to see @StateDept get a role. One of my great ifs I will always wonder is what if the NGO infrastructure for web literacy wasn't pulled in 201","summary":"So glad to see @StateDept get a role. One of my great ifs I will always wonder is what if the NGO infrastructure for web literacy wasn't pulled in 2013-2014 would the world have been more resilient? (also go back and look at Russian/Ukrainian Mozilla spaces 2014, attacked too) https://t.co/H6xNnDIUIc","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:31:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691864029659058656","reply_tweet_id":"1691864029659058656","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>So glad to see @StateDept get a role.<br><br>One of my great ifs I will always wonder is what if the NGO infrastructure for web literacy wasn&#x27;t pulled in 2013-2014 would the world have been more resilient?<br><br>(also go back and look at Russian/Ukrainian Mozilla spaces 2014, attacked too) <a href=\"https://t.co/H6xNnDIUIc\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/H6xNnDIUIc</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f7e5783cea3a685e5ce116547ffac000.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691865401062248709","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f7e5783cea3a685e5ce116547ffac000.jpg"]}
