{"id":"twitter:1691863728579383617","tweet_id":"1691863728579383617","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691863728579383617","title":"funny I would scratch out \"Foundational Cyber Skills\" and replace it with \"#Literacies\" or \"Reading and Writing\" I would add \"Controlling Identities a","summary":"funny I would scratch out \"Foundational Cyber Skills\" and replace it with \"#Literacies\" or \"Reading and Writing\" I would add \"Controlling Identities and Access to My Data\" explicitly if foundational cyber or #literacies skills you must own your own truth to shape that of others https://t.co/CzLuuKEEtN","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:25:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691862488843776380","reply_tweet_id":"1691862488843776380","tags":["Literacies","literacies"],"body_html":"<p>funny I would scratch out &quot;Foundational Cyber Skills&quot; and replace it with &quot;#Literacies&quot; or &quot;Reading and Writing&quot;<br><br>I would add &quot;Controlling Identities and Access to My Data&quot; explicitly if foundational cyber or #literacies skills<br><br>you must own your own truth to shape that of others <a href=\"https://t.co/CzLuuKEEtN\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/CzLuuKEEtN</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/bfde5c0e41fb47fc8b2b13f12c700bf1.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691863728579383617","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/bfde5c0e41fb47fc8b2b13f12c700bf1.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1691862488843776380","tweet_id":"1691862488843776380","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691862488843776380","title":"The squishy stuff and latent variables are included in: Digital resilience: The awareness, skills, agility, and confidence to be empowered users of ne","summary":"The squishy stuff and latent variables are included in: Digital resilience: The awareness, skills, agility, and confidence to be empowered users of new technologies and adapt to changing digital skill demands Dispositions hard AF to measure and to teach, but glad to see them","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:20:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691862067597242372","reply_tweet_id":"1691862067597242372","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The squishy stuff and latent variables are included in:<br><br>Digital resilience: The awareness, skills, agility, and confidence to be empowered users of new technologies and adapt to changing digital skill demands<br><br>Dispositions hard AF to measure and to teach, but glad to see them</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691862488843776380","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1691862067597242372","tweet_id":"1691862067597242372","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691862067597242372","title":"Here we see ISTE standards systems engineering thinking also note the semi-colon. Knowledge and skills included in this \"ability\" There is a bifurcati","summary":"Here we see ISTE standards systems engineering thinking also note the semi-colon. Knowledge and skills included in this \"ability\" There is a bifurcation of Bloom's verbs, especially using Krathwol's remix.","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T17:18:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691861290812141808","reply_tweet_id":"1691861290812141808","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Here we see ISTE standards systems engineering thinking<br><br>also note the semi-colon. Knowledge and skills included in this &quot;ability&quot; <br><br>There is a bifurcation of Bloom&#x27;s verbs, especially using Krathwol&#x27;s remix.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691862067597242372","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 17:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
