{"id":"twitter:1691839602732974092","tweet_id":"1691839602732974092","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691839602732974092","title":"Dispositions, or latent affective variables given same semiotic weight. Interesting to think about the language adoption of \"digital literacy,\" \"compu","summary":"Dispositions, or latent affective variables given same semiotic weight. Interesting to think about the language adoption of \"digital literacy,\" \"computational literacy\" and \"digital resilience\" You get a circle to draw on a cycle metaphor heuristic rather than a taxonomy","date":"2023-08-16","published":"2023-08-16T15:49:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691838952959861114","reply_tweet_id":"1691838952959861114","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Dispositions, or latent affective variables given same semiotic weight.<br><br>Interesting to think about the language adoption of &quot;digital literacy,&quot; &quot;computational literacy&quot; and &quot;digital resilience&quot; <br><br>You get a circle to draw on a cycle metaphor heuristic  rather than a taxonomy</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691839602732974092","display_date":"August 16, 2023 · 15:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
