{"id":"twitter:1691053811878526976","tweet_id":"1691053811878526976","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1691053811878526976","title":"@missfellacatz I am same way I prefer a hard copy. I would say 50% of my students will print out pdfs or prefer a hard copy. Research (from the Academ","summary":"@missfellacatz I am same way I prefer a hard copy. I would say 50% of my students will print out pdfs or prefer a hard copy. Research (from the Academies) may show retention better with paper (though I take issue with the study design and measures) I love all his books. Great writer","date":"2023-08-14","published":"2023-08-14T11:47:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/missfellacatz/status/1691052686169325568","reply_tweet_id":"1691052686169325568","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@missfellacatz I am same way I prefer a hard copy.<br><br>I would say 50% of my students will print out pdfs or prefer a hard copy.<br><br>Research (from the Academies) may show retention better with paper (though I take issue with the study design and measures)<br><br>I love all his books. Great writer</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1691053811878526976","display_date":"August 14, 2023 · 11:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
