{"id":"twitter:1690876368580444160","tweet_id":"1690876368580444160","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1690876368580444160","title":"@PuncheeBurro @JonDArsen @jmwallach and their dysfunction provides stability. I feel the Legislative Branch have absconded their duties a bit and the ","summary":"@PuncheeBurro @JonDArsen @jmwallach and their dysfunction provides stability. I feel the Legislative Branch have absconded their duties a bit and the Executive gained more control through Executive Orders Last President's advisor believed in an almost monarchy in every Article II court case they argued","date":"2023-08-14","published":"2023-08-14T00:01:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PuncheeBurro/status/1690875197899911169","reply_tweet_id":"1690875197899911169","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PuncheeBurro @JonDArsen @jmwallach and their dysfunction provides stability.<br><br>I feel the Legislative Branch have absconded their duties a bit and the Executive gained more control through Executive Orders<br><br>Last President&#x27;s advisor believed in an almost monarchy in every Article II court case they argued</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1690876368580444160","display_date":"August 14, 2023 · 00:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1690875880988442624","tweet_id":"1690875880988442624","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1690875880988442624","title":"@JonDArsen @PuncheeBurro @jmwallach People also did not know how the S-400 would perform (we know now...poorly) and Russia did a decent job bluffing o","summary":"@JonDArsen @PuncheeBurro @jmwallach People also did not know how the S-400 would perform (we know now...poorly) and Russia did a decent job bluffing on the capability And people were tired from Afghanistan and Iraq I understand the decision, but in hindsight I don't think Putin would have invaded. Yet. Maybe","date":"2023-08-13","published":"2023-08-13T23:59:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/JonDArsen/status/1690874671195971584","reply_tweet_id":"1690874671195971584","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@JonDArsen @PuncheeBurro @jmwallach People also did not know how the S-400 would perform (we know now...poorly) and Russia did a decent job bluffing on the capability<br><br>And people were tired from Afghanistan and Iraq<br><br>I understand the decision, but in hindsight I don&#x27;t think Putin would have invaded.<br><br>Yet. Maybe</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1690875880988442624","display_date":"August 13, 2023 · 23:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
