{"id":"twitter:2081400469549723939","tweet_id":"2081400469549723939","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2081400469549723939","title":"@jimminycricketi Can't get it to kick, after I stopped to tighten chain. Air filter clean. Spark plug should still be good. Next step pouring gas dire","summary":"@jimminycricketi Can't get it to kick, after I stopped to tighten chain. Air filter clean. Spark plug should still be good. Next step pouring gas directly into carb. Probably just give up on it Battery on a 21 inch bar lasts like 40 minutes. I would need like 12 batteries. One tree to go https://t.co/NfchQCScBe","date":"2026-07-26","published":"2026-07-26T15:25:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jimminycricketi/status/2081397511177080979","reply_tweet_id":"2081397511177080979","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@jimminycricketi Can&#x27;t get it to kick, after I stopped to tighten chain. Air filter clean. Spark plug should still be good.<br><br>Next step pouring gas directly into carb.<br><br>Probably just give up on it<br><br>Battery on a 21 inch bar lasts like 40 minutes. I would need like 12 batteries.<br><br>One tree to go <a href=\"https://t.co/NfchQCScBe\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/NfchQCScBe</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/a0ad8a1d996c327c4c2377e9e6ad9182.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f219862d0bb9aa8181857cdc542c292e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2081400469549723939","display_date":"July 26, 2026 · 15:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/a0ad8a1d996c327c4c2377e9e6ad9182.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/f219862d0bb9aa8181857cdc542c292e.jpg"]}
