{"id":"twitter:1690334141278027776","tweet_id":"1690334141278027776","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1690334141278027776","title":"Bunch of people thinking how will we get back to Russia? There will be no #CrimeaFuelShortage The Kerch Bridge will stay open. The smoke is to stop GP","summary":"Bunch of people thinking how will we get back to Russia? There will be no #CrimeaFuelShortage The Kerch Bridge will stay open. The smoke is to stop GPS guided missiles. The roads through Melitopol will stay open. Always safe promise. I wouldn't try to leave Ukraine right now https://x.com/giK1893/status/1690316739706335232","date":"2023-08-12","published":"2023-08-12T12:07:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["CrimeaFuelShortage"],"body_html":"<p>Bunch of people thinking how will we get back to Russia?<br><br>There will be no #CrimeaFuelShortage<br><br>The Kerch Bridge will stay open. The smoke is to stop GPS guided missiles.<br><br>The roads through Melitopol will stay open. Always safe promise.<br><br>I wouldn&#x27;t try to leave Ukraine right now <a href=\"https://x.com/giK1893/status/1690316739706335232\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/giK1893/status/1690316739706335232</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1690334141278027776","display_date":"August 12, 2023 · 12:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
