{"id":"twitter:2022686088087900212","tweet_id":"2022686088087900212","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2022686088087900212","title":"@dromanocpm @researchUSAI I would build a data structure based on cult research. I have a theory AI generated bots and reinforcement learning would ma","summary":"@dromanocpm @researchUSAI I would build a data structure based on cult research. I have a theory AI generated bots and reinforcement learning would map well using adtech models And emojs 🇷🇺 🇺🇸 ✝️ ☦️ 💯 🩸 but that could quickly change. Right now emoji in bio effective.","date":"2026-02-14","published":"2026-02-14T14:55:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dromanocpm/status/2022681314890256829","reply_tweet_id":"2022681314890256829","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm @researchUSAI I would build a data structure based on cult research. I have a theory AI generated bots and reinforcement learning would map well using adtech models<br><br>And emojs 🇷🇺 🇺🇸 ✝️ ☦️ 💯 🩸 but that could quickly change.<br><br>Right now emoji in bio effective.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2022686088087900212","display_date":"February 14, 2026 · 14:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:2022679547574129127","tweet_id":"2022679547574129127","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2022679547574129127","title":"@researchUSAI @dromanocpm Start by giving API access to researchers again. Lot of folks were willing to do the work at no cost to Twitter. The phenome","summary":"@researchUSAI @dromanocpm Start by giving API access to researchers again. Lot of folks were willing to do the work at no cost to Twitter. The phenomenon that interests me now is the alignment to influencer networks rather than ideas and hashtags Correlating to adbuys, our 2023 model, still works.","date":"2026-02-14","published":"2026-02-14T14:29:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/researchUSAI/status/2022677037832638526","reply_tweet_id":"2022677037832638526","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@researchUSAI @dromanocpm Start by giving API access to researchers again.<br><br>Lot of folks were willing to do the work at no cost to Twitter.<br><br>The phenomenon that interests me now is the alignment to influencer networks rather than ideas and hashtags<br><br>Correlating to adbuys, our 2023 model, still works.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2022679547574129127","display_date":"February 14, 2026 · 14:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
