{"id":"twitter:1689232482212732928","tweet_id":"1689232482212732928","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1689232482212732928","title":"@AnikaBedson @BonkingtonJones @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tu","summary":"@AnikaBedson @BonkingtonJones @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @ChadDBedson @X @W_Wiewiorowski @metpoliceuk @JoeBiden \"When one day we shall be no mo","date":"2023-08-09","published":"2023-08-09T11:09:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/AnikaBedson/status/1689230020407963648","reply_tweet_id":"1689230020407963648","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@AnikaBedson @BonkingtonJones @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @ChadDBedson @X @W_Wiewiorowski @metpoliceuk @JoeBiden &quot;When one day we shall be no more, then the coming generations<br>shall be able to look back with pride upon this day, the day on which a<br>great Volk affirmed the German community. &quot;<br><br>Putin really could use Hitler&#x27;s speeches. Just replace volk and German with Russian <a href=\"https://t.co/hwD3Q0irtU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/hwD3Q0irtU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d1c2b57a8c711dac3a85a1e9f0733f7a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1689232482212732928","display_date":"August 09, 2023 · 11:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d1c2b57a8c711da