{"id":"twitter:1689230351799832577","tweet_id":"1689230351799832577","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1689230351799832577","title":"@BonkingtonJones @AnikaBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tu","summary":"@BonkingtonJones @AnikaBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @ChadDBedson @X @W_Wiewiorowski @metpoliceuk @JoeBiden Just stop. How to know you are ","date":"2023-08-09","published":"2023-08-09T11:01:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheKindins/status/1689227320270147584","reply_tweet_id":"1689227320270147584","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BonkingtonJones @AnikaBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @DD_Geopolitic @StinkyAsparagus @FrankTrent28 @bushdiditongod @TickedOffTurnip @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @ChadDBedson @X @W_Wiewiorowski @metpoliceuk @JoeBiden Just stop.<br><br>How to know you are talking to a tankie?<br><br>When they refer to Ruthenia and Galacia<br><br>Every time.<br><br>No mention of Zaporizhian Sich and Khmelnytsky Uprising and Catherine&#x27;s betrayal of Hetmanate.<br><br>BTW wasn&#x27;t ther this thing called Kievan Rus before Kingdom of Ruthenia? <a href=\"https://t.co/1sjoS12lk8\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/1sjoS12lk8</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/dd1b14afe5f0707befe88345108bcda5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1689230351799832577","display_date":"August 09, 2023 · 11:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitt