{"id":"twitter:1689020072352677888","tweet_id":"1689020072352677888","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1689020072352677888","title":"@minimagnus2 @3mericanj0hnson I don't, but I understand the anger It's also hard to know who is being sent to jail and who is approved opposition. So ","summary":"@minimagnus2 @3mericanj0hnson I don't, but I understand the anger It's also hard to know who is being sent to jail and who is approved opposition. So I also understand people defaulting to \"If Russia said it, then it isn't true.\" But now let's see how many times they called out talk of fascists in Ukraine https://t.co/jfsi37pYOx","date":"2023-08-08","published":"2023-08-08T21:05:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/minimagnus2/status/1689014127409164291","reply_tweet_id":"1689014127409164291","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@minimagnus2 @3mericanj0hnson I don&#x27;t, but I understand the anger<br><br>It&#x27;s also hard to know who is being sent to jail and who is approved opposition.<br><br>So I also understand people defaulting to &quot;If Russia said it, then it isn&#x27;t true.&quot;<br><br>But now let&#x27;s see how many times they called out talk of fascists in Ukraine <a href=\"https://t.co/jfsi37pYOx\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/jfsi37pYOx</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/1919f3ea482aae71beb1844a1ab09a90.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1689020072352677888","display_date":"August 08, 2023 · 21:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/1919f3ea482aae71beb1844a1ab09a90.jpg"]}
