{"id":"twitter:1688596924297887749","tweet_id":"1688596924297887749","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1688596924297887749","title":"@BonkingtonJones @ChadDBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @BanderaFella @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD","summary":"@BonkingtonJones @ChadDBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @BanderaFella @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD_Geopolitic @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @W_Wiewiorowski @X @AnikaBedson You might be underestimating my resolve on this issue. I am done with ","date":"2023-08-07","published":"2023-08-07T17:04:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TheKindins/status/1688595915500666894","reply_tweet_id":"1688595915500666894","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BonkingtonJones @ChadDBedson @bucktron2021 @NTP2505LF @AngryOniOn7 @BanderaFella @TickedOffTurnip @StinkyAsparagus @tuckfrump43ver @ShortingRound @DD_Geopolitic @PaulDBedson @Paul_Bedson @Reportinat0r @Bellingdawg @HidolfAdlerNAFO @PeImenPusha @PelmenPusha @W_Wiewiorowski @X @AnikaBedson You might be underestimating my resolve on this issue.<br><br>I am done with being defamed by people as a child molester.<br><br>You are either sole or part of coordinated efforts to spam my pic with accusations. You repeatedly make accounts to evade bans on Twitter.<br><br>Do you promise to stop? <a href=\"https://t.co/6Q4QX2lxzl\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6Q4QX2lxzl</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/502812b1832a2211b1f91fee32df0f1b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1688596924297887749","display_date":"August 07, 2023 · 17:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/502812b1832a2211b1f91fee32df0f1b.jpg"]}
